Additional notice

This project is a portfolio and educational work. It is NOT a credit decision
system and MUST NOT be used to make lending decisions about real people or
businesses. The bundled dataset is synthetic: it is generated by
`scripts/generate_dataset.py` from a fixed seed and describes no real applicant.
See MODEL_CARD.md for the model's intended use, limitations and known gaps.
